Teaser:

New optional simplified display for the Link field; new function to scan any folder for Notenik collections contained within. 


Timestamp: 20260909220940

Body:

##### New Link Formatting Option

There is now a simplifying formatting option for the Scheme portion of a [[Link]]. For the Scheme, simplification will result in a simple descriptor of the type of link. For a Scheme of `http` or `https`, the descriptor will be "Web Link"; for the `notenik` scheme, the descriptor will be "Notenik Link", and so forth. When the Scheme is simplified, it is generally best to exclude the other URL parts. This results in a short clickable phrase instead of a long and possibly convoluted URL. 

##### Scan for Collections Added

Added a new function to [[Scan for Collections]], as another means of [[Managing a Bunch of Collections]].
